LOCachy: upstream libinput 1.32 circular scrolling fixes, Panasonic quirks,
a configurable unitless ring width with 300ms dwell, and two-finger scrolling.

The original fixes include upstream !1514 and the CF-SV8 quirk (!1521).
AttrCircularScrollRingWidth and AttrCircularScrollDwell use libinput local
quirks; they do not require a separate input daemon. The ring dwell uses
libinput timers and yields to normal multi-finger scrolling and gestures.

